[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2891481026","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106235#issuecomment-2891481026","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106235","id":2891481026,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sWH_C","user":{"login":"YYF233333","id":67693830,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NjkzODMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67693830?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333","html_url":"https://github.com/YYF233333","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-19T15:38:44Z","updated_at":"2025-05-20T09:35:15Z","body":"Just provide some ideas:\n- We can use static local variable to avoid this problem, C++11 gurantees static local variable is initialized at first call and is thread-safe.\n- For other variables we can give them a lazy init wrapper.\n- For destruction, if a static variable doesn't hold system resource (e.g. FileHandle) and won't block other objects' destruction, we can directly leak them and let OS clean them up.\n\nEdit: I prototype a wrapper for lazy initialization ([diff](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/compare/master...YYF233333:godot:lazy_static)).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2891481026/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2963602589","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106235#issuecomment-2963602589","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106235","id":2963602589,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wpPyd","user":{"login":"kisg","id":406832,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNjgzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/406832?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg","html_url":"https://github.com/kisg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-11T17:18:11Z","updated_at":"2025-06-11T17:18:11Z","body":"\n> * For destruction, if a static variable doesn't hold system resource (e.g. FileHandle) and won't block other objects' destruction, we can directly leak them and let OS clean them up.\n\nThis pattern interferes with the upcoming libgodot feature, where restarting Godot in the same process is a frequent requirement. We already have patches to fix many of these issues on our 4.4 branch (with some more I am fixing tonight ...):  https://github.com/migeran/godot/tree/libgodot_migeran_44\n\nThe best approach is to implement a solution where Godot exits cleanly, and no garbage is left anywhere, especially not in statically allocated memory.\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2963602589/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]